  "hook": "Volarna is a small kingdom on the Adriatic that nobody in America could find on a map. I was a pediatric ICU nurse at a Zagreb hospital who spoke four languages because my Croatian grandmother had insisted. The palace's head of protocol hired me through a recruiter. The contract said Crown Prince Aleksandar needed a fiancée in four weeks or his younger brother Dmitar would win the throne under a 1923 succession clause. The salary was six figures, hazard-pay included. I signed because my nephew needed surgery. The Prince met me at the airport. He looked like he had not slept in a week.",
